# ── Version control ──────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.husky

# ── Dependencies (sẽ được install lại trong container) ──
**/node_modules

# ── Build outputs ────────────────────────────
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage

# ── Database files (dùng volume thay thế) ────
**/prisma/dev.db
**/prisma/*.db
**/prisma/*.db-journal
**/prisma/data
apps/backend/prisma/dataset_bk
apps/backend/prisma/migrations_sqlite_backup

# ── Env files (dùng --env-file hoặc environment trong compose) ──
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# ── Dev tooling ──────────────────────────────
**/.vscode
**/.idea
*.md
!README.md
**/.prettierrc
**/.prettierignore
**/eslint.config.mjs

# ── Logs & temp ──────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/seedlogs-*.txt
**/pending-files.txt

# ── Test files ───────────────────────────────
**/test
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/__tests__

# ── Next.js cache ────────────────────────────
**/.next/cache

# ── TypeScript build info ────────────────────
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# ── Certificates (nếu chỉ dùng local dev) ────
**/certificates

# ── Gemini / AI artifacts ────────────────────
**/.gemini
**/skills
**/issue

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────
**/image.png
**/prisma.md
